Package: pivotwbmilly
Title: Reshape World Bank Mortality Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Milly", "Wu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "125825028+millywucello@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Converts wide World Bank mortality tables into country-year
    records using the data preparation function from CHL5233 Week 3.
    Includes the course-supplied maternal mortality data, examples, and
    checks for missing columns and duplicate country codes.
